==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|humbel}}, {{m|gmh|hummel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|humbal}}, {{m|goh|humbala}}, {{m|goh|humbalo}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|hommel}}, {{cog|da|humlebi}}, {{cog|sv|humla}}. Eventually probably {{onomatopoeic|de|title=onomatopoeic}} and related with {{m+|en|hum}}.

Compare English ''[[bumblebee]]'', which has {{w|Middle English}} ''[[bombeln]]'' ("to buzz") as its first element.

